{
  "//": [
    "Every index leads with _tenant_id. Firestore requires equality-filtered",
    "fields to precede the ordered field in a composite index, and every query",
    "in store.py now filters on tenant first -- so an index without it is an",
    "index Firestore will refuse to use, and the query fails outright rather",
    "than running unscoped. That failure mode is the right one: a query that",
    "silently dropped the tenant filter would return another customer's data.",
    "",
    "Deploy with: gcloud firestore indexes composite create, or",
    "firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes"
  ],
  "indexes": [
    {
      "//": "query_cases with a state filter, and the review queue",
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "state", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "query_cases with no state filter, list_cases, compliance/reports",
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "find_case_by_client_reference -- the idempotency check on the hot path",
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "client_reference", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "count_by_cleared_by",
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "state", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "cleared_by", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": [
        "sum_rollups -- the five below are one index per summed field.",
        "",
        "A sum() carrying an equality filter needs the summed field in the same",
        "index as the filtered one; Firestore will not combine the tenant filter",
        "with a separate single-field index on the metric. Nothing here is",
        "optional and nothing collapses into one composite index either, because",
        "each aggregation is issued as its own query.",
        "",
        "These were missing when the tenant-scoped store shipped, and the effect",
        "was not a slow query but FAILED_PRECONDITION on sum_rollups() -- which",
        "orchestrator.snapshot() calls, so GET /api/v1/orchestrator/state and",
        "GET /api/v1/billing/usage both returned 500 and the operations",
        "dashboard went blank."
      ],
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_input_tokens", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_output_tokens", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_agent_calls", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_estimated_cost_usd", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_sum_latency_ms", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": [
        "sum_rollups WITH A BILLING PERIOD -- the five below add created_at.",
        "",
        "Same rule as the five above, one step further: a sum() carrying an",
        "equality filter AND a range filter needs all three fields in one index.",
        "The unbounded indexes above do not serve a windowed call, and the",
        "windowed ones do not replace them, so all ten are required.",
        "",
        "Learned by measurement, and the principle was already written above:",
        "a first attempt created only (_tenant_id, created_at) and the query",
        "failed with FAILED_PRECONDITION naming _input_tokens -- the first of the",
        "five sums to be issued.",
        "",
        "These are needed only once a period is requested, so a deployment",
        "without them keeps serving the dashboard and fails on the first",
        "invoice. Create them with infra/monitoring/create_billing_indexes.py."
      ],
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_input_tokens", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_output_tokens", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_agent_calls", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_estimated_cost_usd", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "created_at", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "_sum_latency_ms", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "list_events, query_events",
      "collectionGroup": "events",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "list_audit, and query_audit with no field filter",
      "collectionGroup": "audit_log",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "audit_log",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "case_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "audit_log",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "action", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "audit_log",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "status", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "at", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "active_boundary",
      "collectionGroup": "delegation_boundaries",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "status", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "list_boundaries",
      "collectionGroup": "delegation_boundaries",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "_tenant_id", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "version", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fieldOverrides": []
}
